Dialogue: 5,0:00:02.75,0:00:04.38,Text CN - Shiroha,,366,0,0,,我開動了
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.10,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,888,0,,好好吃!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.10,Text CN - Shiroha,,999,0,0,,好好吃!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.25,0:00:23.50,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,1145,0,,再來一碗!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.25,0:00:23.50,Text CN - Shiroha,,1145,0,0,,再來一碗!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:24.24,0:00:26.65,Text CN - Shiroha,,0,0,0,,我 我現在去煮  你們先等會
