Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.75,0:00:04.38,Text JP - Shiroha,,0,366,0,,いただきま～す！
Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.75,0:00:04.38,Text JP - Shiroha,,366,0,0,,いただきま～す！
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.10,Text JP - Shiroha,,0,888,0,,おいしい！
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.10,Text JP - Shiroha,,999,0,0,,おいしい！
